{"screen_name": "kirokaro_o", "file": "kirokaro_o-1e6518", "name": "きろかろ", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1687463996327448576/BKe70-Wk.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1439377928299499520/1691812159/1500x500", "description": "お絵描き&TRPG垢。ほぼ壁打ち。ペースはゆっくり。無断転載❌ 【お仕事】webtoon『陛下、今度は私が育てます！』人物線画担当。【好き】 創作、第五人格、CoC7版、フタリソウサ、ネクロニカ ■skeb📄http://skeb.jp/@kirokaro_o （リクエスト停止中）", "total_works": 43, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 15000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T12:06:05.670594+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 15000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 15000, "max": 15000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/kirokaro_o", "name": "kirokaro_o"}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/59784842", "name": "59784842"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@kirokaro_o/works/43", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4284ad73/uploads/origins/3a82ec6a-61c0-41be-8a18-08dc13f3e19a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29615a42f621ef7efcddd1ba9142c619", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4284ad73/uploads/origins/3a82ec6a-61c0-41be-8a18-08dc13f3e19a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=29615a42f621ef7efcddd1ba9142c619, https://si.imgix.net/4284ad73/uploads/origins/3a82ec6a-61c0-41be-8a18-08dc13f3e19a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1375f7d3f67a80670aa1e7538e593bae 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4284ad73/uploads/origins/3a82ec6a-61c0-41be-8a18-08dc13f3e19a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=43c2ed83327a9c4baf1c2666987af83f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I'd like to request a character design.\n\nThe character I would like is a sea wolf. I want her to give off childhood best friend vibes and be a smart and cute always happy type character. Personality wise - loyal best friend who often gets in trouble, but is always excited and looking forward to new things, especially if it's food.\n\nI really love the face structure, the big round eyes and the tuft on the wolf ears, so please keep them in the design if possible - https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1147955505839493272/1190319859838488586/image.png?ex=65aa9941&is=65982441&hm=9a997f2191fcbb6118af41da1707bb0805eec09882239cd8bfb5fa096f22a4a4&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=1251&height=704\n\nI want her eyes to have paws inside them. The above reference has an example for that, but I'd love it if they had more life or were more expressive.\n\nHair color: Oreo (black and white) with one orange streak (strand). For hairstyle, you can choose. I love the short hair in the eye example, but I also like ponytail, twin tail, long hair etc. \n\nBody type: The picture on the bottom left shows the body size and curves - https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1147955505839493272/1190319860610257046/image.png?ex=65aa9941&is=65982441&hm=2766dec9e04325ba732caaf013aee1ecf1a9decb231061854b85275bc72081c9&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=1082&height=704\n\nOutfit - I provided some references for a style, but you're welcome to create a completely different outfit!\n\nI want her to be a sea wolf, but I am unsure how to incorporate the sea part into the design. Perhaps with a more watery tail or scale type tail? \n\nFeel free to take creative liberties as you see fit.\n\nThank you so much for considering this!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kirokaro_o/works/42", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/df8cc4f7/uploads/origins/4e1b4270-6510-4545-a46e-195c6f51f52e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=468d79d12f9b64c3db7a9cf9cec85bfe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/df8cc4f7/uploads/origins/4e1b4270-6510-4545-a46e-195c6f51f52e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=468d79d12f9b64c3db7a9cf9cec85bfe, https://si.imgix.net/df8cc4f7/uploads/origins/4e1b4270-6510-4545-a46e-195c6f51f52e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f69be9233999919ebb1a6e3f6297ede3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/df8cc4f7/uploads/origins/4e1b4270-6510-4545-a46e-195c6f51f52e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e96ea2571f4b3f483f74358a48b146d3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "またまた先生、こんにちは、\n前回のアート、ありがとうございました！\nあなたは私のビジョンに命を吹き込む素晴らしい仕事をしてくれました。\n今回は少し難しい仕事をお願いしたいと思います。今回はまだ正確なデザインを持っていないOCなので、謙虚に制作をお願いします :)。   \n彼女はRPGのキャラクターではなく、私のほろ苦いファンタジーです。\nあなたのような才能あるアーティストにリクエストする一方で、私は自分のキャラクターで好きな漫画のコマを再現するのが大好きです。  これをベースに何か描いてほしい：\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hellsing/images/5/52/HarkonnenII.png\n初音ミクにインスパイアされた私のキャラクターで（はい、私はその愚かな外人です :D）、女の子はティールのツインテール、銀色の目、セラスのような「発達した」体、ゴスロリの服を着ています。彼女はちょっといたずらっぽく笑っているはずだ :)。\nオリジナルの武器の代わりに、黒と青のエネルギーで光る魔法のデュアルセミオートキャノン。\nこの部分は、実はこの奇妙なリクエストの核心である。私は、王国全体を破滅に追い込むために設計されたこの武器を、自分の発明を披露するかわいいアニメの女の子の形で見てみたいのだ。\nそれが、この武器のインスピレーションの源になると思うのだ：\nhttps://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aion/images/7/7f/Aethercannon_equipped.png/revision/latest?cb=20140201194522", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kirokaro_o/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f5581de7/uploads/origins/cede16e5-fefb-44be-ba2e-71b82eb50ce4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a5097febf1acf2c18a0937c86aa34a37", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f5581de7/uploads/origins/cede16e5-fefb-44be-ba2e-71b82eb50ce4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a5097febf1acf2c18a0937c86aa34a37, https://si.imgix.net/f5581de7/uploads/origins/cede16e5-fefb-44be-ba2e-71b82eb50ce4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1aa1f87156c1d1fd91481789a94b949c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f5581de7/uploads/origins/cede16e5-fefb-44be-ba2e-71b82eb50ce4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=5d35a50f8d50c639598d14b6dd3c5f00 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kirokaro_o/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8e9c4952/uploads/origins/5fb2a2f6-617d-4f05-a6b0-0ea22f47ef9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e96c2f986f66a475523fd57bf7dc6ef3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8e9c4952/uploads/origins/5fb2a2f6-617d-4f05-a6b0-0ea22f47ef9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e96c2f986f66a475523fd57bf7dc6ef3, https://si.imgix.net/8e9c4952/uploads/origins/5fb2a2f6-617d-4f05-a6b0-0ea22f47ef9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf41637f5cf11ea0f8ac96f035bad324 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8e9c4952/uploads/origins/5fb2a2f6-617d-4f05-a6b0-0ea22f47ef9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e0506eb2254d2f870b9f898bf871034 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして、突然のリクエスト失礼します。\nファイアーエムブレム新紋章の謎・ヒーローズのエレミヤ様（http://imgur.com/DSkLLd5.png）を描いてほしいです。\n冷たい表情でこちらを見ているイラストをお願いします。\n怒っているわけではなく睨んでいるわけでもなく、何かゴミを見るような軽蔑の眼差しで見てるような表情です。\nその他細かい構図や背景等はお任せします。\n漠然とした注文で難しいかもしれませんが、何卒よろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@kirokaro_o/works/39", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/6d30206f/uploads/origins/dd2f5e7d-99d5-4c44-a296-e1a53805f394?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txt